hmm.  That's bad.
so I am thinking I need to configure my classpath for the webapp
You shouldn't need to.. and you shouldn't do it that way.
The classes you're symlinking into /usr/share/tomcat-5.5/server/lib, are they all also in &lt;my webapp&gt;/WEB-INF/classes/&lt;packageroot&gt;?
